{
  "description": "The image shows a single large, muscular felid standing in profile facing to the right with its head turned slightly toward the viewer. The body is robust and low-slung with a tawny golden-brown coat that is paler cream-white on the chest, belly, chin and lower muzzle, and has faint darker striping across the back, sides and legs. The head is broad with a short muzzle, the neck and chest have a ruff of longer shaggy fur, the legs are thick and sturdy ending in large paws, and a short tail with a dark tip extends from the rear. The animal is depicted on a plain off-white background with a soft shadow beneath its feet, rendered in a detailed natural-history illustration style.",
